  "details": "So I know world owners/instance owners/world moderators are able to remove stickers from instances by clicking on their bubble and clicking remove sticker. But why not make the same feature work with portals? If you can manually place portals, why not give those same abilities to removing them? Since portals have their own collider pill, just add an extra option when clicking on a portal to \"remove portal\" so that way if a portal gets stuck or put in an inappropriate place, you can have a way to remove them forcibly.\n\nThank you kindly!",
